e LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Flock \/ LED","offer_id":41404937994440,"sku":"RUSFLOCK-T7.5-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RushmoreFlockLED.jpg?v=1723214362"},{"product_id":"9-foot-rushmore-flock-tree-led","title":"9' Rushmore Flock Artificial Christmas Tree 1000 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the forests near Mt. Rushmore to the heart of your home, experience the timeless beauty of this majestic tree during the holidays. Expertly crafted to capture the beauty of the Ponderosa Pine, its layered branches and lifelike detail make it practically indistinguishable from the real tree. A striking centerpiece, it brings the genuine magic of the holiday season to your family traditions.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Flock \/ LED","offer_id":41404942581960,"sku":"RUSFLOCK-T9-L","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RushmoreFlockLED_33cc8cb4-ae56-42fb-8084-561ddbdabab7.jpg?v=1723214406"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Joseline_Lugo1.jpg?v=1759775864","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/sparse-artificial-christmas-trees.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}